        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"e05d7809-2f2c-439a-9181-00835c225725\",\"review_text\":\"This was amazing because I play my song and back my screen easily\"},{\"review_id\":\"bf6fd1a0-a3fa-4411-8208-cc26b3245291\",\"review_text\":\"Awesome👏😊👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"a2778af2-e050-4129-bd7a-73e9ecdc1bb8\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent choice of music\"},{\"review_id\":\"e38b2205-2699-489e-993c-46c5a79125b2\",\"review_text\":\"NOT YOUTUBE\"},{\"review_id\":\"eb9f51e9-0eb3-4ff2-aad8-65970110bbed\",\"review_text\":\"Listen to good music and old music\"},{\"review_id\":\"a6b93f2a-f667-4d7c-a04f-d452cdedf399\",\"review_text\":\"I love this program very much but the problem is when I play a song and turn off the Wafia the songs turn off\"},{\"review_id\":\"18ffa5ee-7da1-488a-9606-731680cd2d64\",\"review_text\":\"So many problems 😠 plz improve this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"e7c80260-b628-40e2-8759-8a564d4ddc5e\",\"review_text\":\"Haven't used this app in years but tried again today so I could use a song for my alarm. Did a search for search lights by psychopathic rydas and pressed play just to immediately get 2 ads in a row. And as soon as the ads ended surprise by the killjoy club started playing! Uninstalling immediately!\"},{\"review_id\":\"fc263838-9e0f-4a1b-8406-335b2893b0eb\",\"review_text\":\"Day by day Spotify become worse.😔😔\"},{\"review_id\":\"ba9059f7-e458-4e4e-9b39-23b58a3e256c\",\"review_text\":\"😡😡😡😡\"}]}"
